    <item>
      <title>A Final Response to &#39;not two-ness&#39;</title>
      <link>https://vishvAsa.github.io/AgamaH_brAhmaH/shAnkara-darshanam/tattvam/en/tony-parsons/a-final-response-to-not-two-ness/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>https://vishvAsa.github.io/AgamaH_brAhmaH/shAnkara-darshanam/tattvam/en/tony-parsons/a-final-response-to-not-two-ness/</guid>
      <description>&lt;h1 id=&#34;a-final-response-to-not-two-ness-tony-parsons&#34;&gt;A Final Response to &amp;rsquo;not two-ness&amp;rsquo; Tony Parsons&lt;/h1&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Source: &lt;a href=&#34;https://www.advaita.org.uk/discourses/trad_neo/final_parsons.htm&#34;&gt;TW&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Author: Tony Parsons&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;http://www.amazon.com/exec/obidos/ASIN/0953303233/fromtheunreat-20&#34;&gt;&lt;figure class=&#34;&#34;&gt;&#xA;&#xA;    &lt;a href=&#34;https://www.advaita.org.uk/images/nothing_parsons.jpg&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;&gt;&#xA;        &lt;img src=&#34;https://www.advaita.org.uk/images/nothing_parsons.jpg&#34; alt=&#34;&#34; title=&#34;&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/a&gt;&#xA;&#xA;    &#xA;&#xA;&lt;/figure&gt;&#xA;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Purchase Tony&amp;rsquo;s latest book, &amp;lsquo;&lt;a href=&#34;http://www.amazon.com/exec/obidos/ASIN/0953303233/fromtheunreat-20&#34;&gt;Nothing Being Everything&lt;/a&gt;&amp;rsquo; from &lt;a href=&#34;http://www.amazon.com/exec/obidos/ASIN/0953303233/fromtheunreat-20&#34;&gt;Amazon.com&lt;/a&gt; or &lt;a href=&#34;http://www.amazon.co.uk/exec/obidos/ASIN/0953303233/thespiritupat-21&#34;&gt;Amazon.co.uk&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;http://www.theopensecret.com/&#34;&gt;Visit Tony Parson&amp;rsquo;s Website&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Link to the entry on the &lt;a href=&#34;https://www.advaita.org.uk/teachers/neo_teachers1.htm#parsons&#34;&gt;Current Teacher&amp;rsquo;s page&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Most of the recent &amp;ldquo;traditionalist&amp;rdquo; responses to my TA versus NA essay clearly confirm again that there is no recognition of the one fundamental difference between these two perspectives, and this renders any debate futile.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;The relentless need to set right against wrong very successfully demonstrates the incomprehension of a message that points to that which is beyond both.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
